  <content>
  <section><para>Complete the following questions to practice the skills you have learned in this lesson.</para>
<!--Do not edit this div tag.  It must surround the interaction block-->
<section class="check-understanding"><exercise data-content-id="d56227b2-abf5-4831-b15d-b10b90ce5382"><problem><para>
      <para>For questions 1 – 5, factor using perfect square trinomials.</para>
      <para>\(9y^2 + 24y + 16\)
        </para>
      </para><para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\((4y\;\ – \;\ 3)^2\)</para><para>\((3y\;\  – \;\ 4)^2\)</para><para>\((3y + 4)^2\)</para><para>\((4y + 3)^2\)</para></problem><solution><para>\((3y + 4)^2\)</para><para>
      <para>The correct answer is \((3y + 4)^2\).
      </para>
    </para></solution></exercise></section></section>
</content>
